[32m+[m[32m## The Two Tasks[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Detection.** Classify and localise each spacecraft with a bounding box. There are 10 mission classes: Cheops, LisaPathfinder, ObservationSat1, Proba2, Proba3, Proba3ocs, Smart1, Soho, VenusExpress, and XMM Newton.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Segmentation.** Assign every pixel to one of three classes. We use the encoding `0 = background`, `1 = spacecraft body`, `2 = solar panels`. Each image contains one or two objects to segment, regardless of which spacecraft it is.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mBoth tasks share the same workflow: prepare the data, train the model, run inference, and format the output for Codabench.[m
