[32m+[m[32m| Loss | VariFocal, GIoU and L1 with weights 1 : 2 : 5 |[m
[32m+[m[32m| Optimizer | AdamW, backbone LR 1e-5, other parameters LR 1e-4, weight decay 1e-4 |[m
[32m+[m[32m| LR schedule | MultiStepLR, decay by 0.1 at epochs 28 and 36 |[m
[32m+[m[32m| Input size | 640 by 640 |[m
[32m+[m[32m| Training | 40 epochs, mixed precision (AMP), batch size 8 |[m
