[32m+[m[32mAnnotations are converted from the SPARK CSV format into COCO JSON before training (`scripts/detection/convert_spark_to_coco.py`). Separate learning rates are used for the backbone and the detection head because they converge differently. The checkpoint with the best validation AP is kept for inference. Training was tracked with Weights and Biases.[m
