[31m-| **mIoU** | **0.326** |[m
[31m-[m
[31m-> Note: The Codabench segmentation score (0.88) differs from the local validation mIoU because Codabench evaluates on the held-out test split using its own metric definition (focused on foreground classes only).  [m
