[31m----[m
[32m+[m[32mThe foreground IoU is low, which is consistent with pixel perfect segmentation being very hard on thin, rare structures. This is why we also looked at the predictions visually. The overlays show that the spacecraft silhouette and main body are captured well, with the panels remaining the hardest region.[m
